/**

So the basic structure would be

action divider
action start
action plan
{
[
action step  x p times        ...(for the same file/fileleaf/tagnode/metadatafile)
action_name_checkpoint        ...(for above file)
]            x q times        ...(for total number of files/fileleafs/tagnodes/metadatafiles)
action_category_checkpoint    ...(for above category)
}            x r times        ...(for all categories in action)
action_end



*/